'''Painted''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 1,000 [[Eggs (Currency)|Eggs]] {{Currency|Egg}} during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made up of a multicolored zig zag pattern. The colors within the pattern consists of white, magenta, yellow, and light pink. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia==
*It has a [[Painted (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

